@@section 1
@@title Flower potting audit, 2026-10-27 ([flower_pots.md](../flower_pots.md), TODO `blocks/framed-and-decor #6`)
@@date 2026-10-27
@@jars creativebrewing creativecompat
@@sources feature_writeup/flower_pots.md
@@text
@@text Audit tooling only, no pack behavior change; none of these blocks another feature. Target: the instance's
@@text `kubejs/` as of 2026-10-27 (new `server_scripts/_lib/dump_flower_pots.js`) and the jars in `mods/`; no new jar.
@@text Probe: copy `tools/flower_pot_test/pot_probe.js` into `srv/kubejs/server_scripts/zz_pot_probe.js` before boot.
@@text Output lines `[pottest] PASS|FAIL|INFO <id> ...` in `logs/latest.log`; the probe runs one holder per few ticks, 30
@@text plants per tick (about 370 plants x 12 holders, expect 1-3 minutes). After the run copy
@@text `srv/kubejs/exported/blocks/flower_pots.json` and `pot_probe.json` into the instance's `kubejs/exported/blocks/`,
@@text then `python3 tools/flower_pot_audit.py` (prints mismatches and exceptions; read the matrix's "Probe against
@@text prediction" section).
