@@table world
## SQ-POT-01
@group A or B
@commands `/dumppots`
@pass `Dumped N potted blocks, M other pot-like blocks, P plants`; `fullPots` has `farmersrespite:wild_tea_bush`, the 5 `rusticdelight:wild_*`, `supplementaries:flax`, 35 `quark:` entries and no `vinery:` key (F2); `potLike` lists flower_box, hanging_flower_pot, planter(s), planter boxes, large_pot, vinery pot / box, silt pots, Handcrafted pots, framed pot; no `planter_rich_soul` (F4)
@fails `getFullPotsView` hidden from Rhino: read the map with `Blocks.FLOWER_POT.fullPots` through reflection; empty `plants`: check `instanceof $BlockItem` in Rhino
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> dumppots
waitlog Dumped \d+ potted blocks, \d+ other pot-like blocks, \d+ plants 300
shell python3 -c "import json,sys; d=json.load(open('kubejs/exported/blocks/flower_pots.json')); fp=d['fullPots']; pl=json.dumps(d['potLike']); need=['farmersrespite:wild_tea_bush','supplementaries:flax']; miss=[k for k in need if k not in fp]; rw=[k for k in fp if k.startswith('rusticdelight:wild_')]; q=[k for k in fp if k.startswith('quark:')]; v=[k for k in fp if k.startswith('vinery:')]; print('missing', miss, 'rustic wild', len(rw), 'quark', len(q), 'vinery', v, 'soul planter', 'planter_rich_soul' in pl); sys.exit(0 if not miss and len(rw)==5 and not v and 'planter_rich_soul' not in pl else 1)"
shell python3 -c "import json; d=json.load(open('kubejs/exported/blocks/flower_pots.json')); print(json.dumps(d['potLike'])[:1500])"
look quark entries 35 (shell line 1); potLike lists flower_box, hanging_flower_pot, planter(s), planter boxes, large_pot, vinery pot / box, silt pots, Handcrafted pots, framed pot (shell line 2)
## SQ-POT-02
@group A
@commands `forceload add 290 290 350 310`, wait 5 s, `/pottest all`, wait for `PP-DONE`
@pass `PASS PP-01` (vanilla pot = map), `PASS PP-02` for the framed and hanging pots; `PP-SUM` lines give per-holder counts close to [flower_pots.md](../flower_pots.md) 1
@fails PP-01 FAIL naming a plant: a potted block whose plant item differs from the block (record it in POTTED_ITEM in `tools/flower_pot_audit.py`); hanging pot all refused: the probe clicks its north face, try `up` from below; `holder did not place`: the spec's state props (flower box `floor`, AF `facing`)
