> forceload add 290 290 350 310
sleep 5
> pottest all
waitlog \[pottest\] INFO PP-DONE 900
expect \[pottest\] PASS PP-01
expect \[pottest\] PASS PP-02
count \[pottest\] FAIL PP-0[12]: == 0
shell grep -aE '\[pottest\] .*PP-SUM' logs/latest.log | cut -c1-200 | head -30
look PP-SUM per-holder counts close to flower_pots.md section 1 (probe copied fresh from tools/flower_pot_test/pot_probe.js)
