@commands grep `PP-03`; for any FAIL read the `stack` field of that row in `kubejs/exported/blocks/pot_probe.json`
@pass `PASS PP-03` for every holder, 0 `minecraft:hanging_roots` exceptions (Immersive Weathering wall roots no longer get `facing=up`: hanging roots against the top of a holder do nothing); planter box and fungi caps pass (F1 struck)
@fails `Cannot set property ... facing ... to up` again: `WallRootsVerticalFaceMixin` (CD `mixin/immersive_weathering`) not applied, check the boot log for the CD mixin config; another exception: its frames are in `stack`
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-20
> dumppots
waitlog Dumped \d+ potted blocks 300
> pottest all
waitlog \[pottest\] INFO PP-DONE 900
