## SQ-POT-09 | melon, pumpkin, carved pumpkin, jack o'lantern, moss block and moss carpet are in the box ban tags and out of the box plant lists; the boxes refuse them
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest tag item creativecompat:not_in_flower_boxes`; `/cdevtest tag item another_furniture:planter_box_banned`; `/cdevtest tag item creativecompat:flower_box_plants`; a `supplementaries:flower_box`, an `another_furniture:oak_planter_box` and a `vinery:flower_box` at 860 -60 700 / 862 / 864; `/cdevtest use` each with `minecraft:melon` and `minecraft:poppy`, `/cdevtest be` each
@pass ban tag n=8 with the six new ids and both azaleas; planter_box_banned holds them; flower_box_plants holds none of them; after the melon clicks no box's block entity lists `minecraft:melon` (a melon block may be placed next to it by the item's own use); the poppy goes into each
@fails `misctags.js` `not_in_flower_boxes`; `SuppFlowerBoxPlantsMixin`; Vinery `LegacyFlowerBoxBlock` reading `flower_box_plants`
@reviewed 2026-11-20
